<<<
 It is from the last incorrect form that the non-reflexive active is logically enough deduced, so that avai of the offer takes the place of the original avail oneself of the offer. Avat , which perhaps encourages the use of these bad constructions, lends them no real support;
===
 It is from the last incorrect form that the non-reflexive active is logically enough deduced, so that *avail of the offer* takes the place of the original *avail oneself of the offer*. *Available*, which perhaps encourages the use of these bad constructions, lends them no real support;
